      "t": "In this scene focused on the stolen car, Elena discovers her car is missing and threatens Barinov, who then forces a confession from Fedya. Let's listen closely to Chef Barinov and Elena's exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
