      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ты зеркало починил?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's review the scene step by step.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Постучаться не учили?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't they teach you to knock?' -- Barinov yells at Elena for entering without permission.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я звоню в полицию.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am calling the police.' -- The angry woman threatens the Chef immediately.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Где моя машина?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is my car? I have no idea.' -- He denies any knowledge of her missing vehicle.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Понятия не имею.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is it. I have had enough.' -- Elena loses her patience with his lies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Значит так, мне все это надоело.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If in five minutes my car is not back...' -- She sets a strict deadline for its return.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Если через пять минут...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am reporting it stolen.' -- She promises to involve the authorities soon.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "моей машины не будет на месте...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you understand me? That is all.' -- She demands a clear answer from him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "я заявляю об угоне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before I kill you, answer one question.' -- The furious Chef corners his cook Fedya.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Вы меня хорошо поняли?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you take the car?' -- He demands an explanation for the theft.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Все.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, he could not make it.' -- Fedya tries to explain the confusing situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Перед тем, как я тебя убью...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He told me to bring the car.' -- He claims he was just following orders.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "ответь мне на вопрос.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did you even start it? What did you use to unlock it?' -- Barinov wonders how Fedya drove without keys.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ты зачем увез машину?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, whatever I used to unlock it, I used to start it.' -- The thief gives a very suspicious answer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф, у него не получилось приехать.",
      "gap": 0.55
